  "description": "Returning student Huiram is ready to dive headfirst into college life, dreaming of late-night chats and hanging out with his new roommate. Instead, he arrives to a completely empty room - except for a stuffed doll of his absolute favorite anime character. Abandoned before the semester even starts, Huiram has no choice but to settle in. What starts as a bizarre arrangement quickly turns into the ultimate, unpredictable roomie experience with a giant stuffed companion.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
